從 OFAC_SPEC（GROUPID = 5）反查哪些人是「死人」，直接透過 remark（即 EntityId）關聯回原始實體表 BSADB.dbo.DJ_Entity，篩選 Deceased = 1 即可：
SELECT 
    O.ent_num,
    O.spec_name,
    O.remark AS EntityId,
    O.updated_date,
    O.DOB,
    E.Deceased,
    E.FullName AS DJ_Entity_FullName
FROM BSADBJP..OFAC_SPEC O
JOIN BSADB.dbo.DJ_Entity E 
  ON O.remark = CAST(E.EntityId AS VARCHAR(100))
WHERE O.GROUPID = 5 
  AND O.DInd = 'N'
  AND E.Deceased = 1;

補充：如果想連同死亡日期一起抓出來
若想確認 Dow Jones 登記的具體死亡日期，可以再串接 DJ_DateTypeInfo：
SELECT 
    O.ent_num,
    O.spec_name,
    O.remark AS EntityId,
    O.updated_date,
    E.Deceased,
    D.InfoYear + '-' + ISNULL(D.InfoMonth, '00') + '-' + ISNULL(D.InfoDay, '00') AS DeceasedDate
FROM BSADBJP..OFAC_SPEC O
JOIN BSADB.dbo.DJ_Entity E 
  ON O.remark = CAST(E.EntityId AS VARCHAR(100))
LEFT JOIN BSADB.dbo.DJ_DateTypeInfo D 
  ON E.EntityId = D.EntityId 
 AND D.DateType LIKE '%Deceased%' 
 AND D.Deleted = 0
WHERE O.GROUPID = 5 
  AND O.DInd = 'N'
  AND E.Deceased = 1;

